 list tonight, so which tasks mention Ubirajara at all?\"], [\"umm when is… when's the Aylin thing?\", \"ok different thing, can you, uh, book Benoe Wharf on their website for saturday?\", \"oh and who am I having… who's the lunch with on saturday?\", \"hmm and which tasks, like, mention Ubirajara?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0041\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please log twenty dollars for snacks in the Malvern trip? I paid for them.\", \"Would you mind starring the scan document, and adding a task to print the scan next monday, please?\", \"Could you jot down a note that says gift ideas for Ubirajara, please?\", \"Could you tell me whether I owe Anastasios Jorrak anything?\", \"Would you let me know when Efua's birthday is, please?\"], [\"add twenty dollars for snacks to Malvern trip, i paid\", \"star the scan doc pls and add a task to print the scan next monday\", \"jot a note down: gift ideas for Ubirajara\", \"do i owe Anastasios Jorrak anything?\", \"when's Efua's bday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0042\", \"v\": [[\"umm so how much have I… how much have I spent in cresvaet gang?\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in cresvaet gang, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0043\", \"v\": [[\"uh what have I been spending on in, um, cresvaet gang?\", \"ok different thing, can you add seven dollars for bike hire to the Malvern trip group, I paid for it\", \"and the first one, who's… who's in that one?\", \"oh and can you message Ubirajara the door code?\"], [\"I'm trying to get a handle on where the money's been going lately, so what are the expenses in cresvaet gang?\", \"Also, I forgot to put this in earlier — could you add seven dollars for bike hire to the Malvern trip group? I was the one who paid.\", \"Hmm, I can't remember who's actually part of the first one, so who's in it?\", \"Separate thing, they're arriving before me and will be stuck outside otherwise, so could you message Ubirajara the door code?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0044\", \"v\": [[\"umm where do I stand with Gosou in the, uh, beekeeping fund?\", \"ok and Yvette?\", \"can you, like, list who's in the beekeeping fund group?\", \"wait who's my… who's my former colleague again?\"], [\"Could you tell me where I stand with Gosou in the beekeeping fund, please?\", \"And Yvette?\", \"Would you mind listing the people in the beekeeping fund group?\", \"Could you remind me who my former colleague is?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0045\", \"v\": [[\"show me the pics from the Malvern trip\"], [\"Could you please show me the photos from the Malvern trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0047\", \"v\": [[\"Would you please get rid of every cushion picture I have?\"], [\"umm can you delete… just get rid of every cushion picture, all of them\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0048\", \"v\": [[\"I'm always terrible at remembering these things and I'd hate to miss it again, so is Gosou Soderberg's birthday coming up soon?\", \"Also, that one's been sitting there forever and it's not happening, so could you delete the pumpkin task?\"], [\"umm is Gosou Soderberg's birthday, like, coming up?\", \"oh and can you, uh, delete the pumpkin task?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0049\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out how many snacks to bring along, so who is coming to the kite workshop?\", \"Oh, I feel like I haven't caught up with Dunja in ages — when did we last speak?\", \"Before I forget, I paid 50 dollars for a taxi the other night, can you put it in cresvaet gang so it's split properly?\"], [\"who's coming to the kite workshop\", \"when did i last talk to Dunja\", \"paid 50 dollars for a taxi, put it in cresvaet gang pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0050\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's the… when is the kite workshop?\"], [\"Could you tell me when the kite workshop is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0052\", \"v\": [[\"whats the wifi at Growen Bakery\", \"anything in my calendar abt it too?\", \"who's coming to the hurling one\", \"what events are they coming to\", \"who else will be at the collect one\", \"phoned the second one, log it pls\"], [\"um what's the wifi at the Growen Bakery?\", \"oh and is there, like, anything in my calendar about it too?\", \"ok the hurling one, who's… who's coming to that?\", \"and what events are they, um, coming to?\", \"hmm and the collect one, who else is gonna be there?\", \"ok so I phoned the second one, can you log that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0053\", \"v\": [[\"my favourite photos\"], [\"I want to put together a little slideshow for myself tonight, so could you pull up the photos I've marked as favourites?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0054\", \"v\": [[\"mark the debt w Gosou as paid\", \"how many pics from Malvern?\", \"do i have any paperwork about the ottoman\"], [\"umm can you mark the debt with Gosou as, uh, paid?\", \"ok and how many pictures are there from Malvern?\", \"oh and do I have any… any paperwork about the ottoman?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0055\", \"v\": [[\"umm what have I got… what's on in 4 days?\"], [\"what's on in 4 days?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0056\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I owe Fionnuala Rivas, please?\", \"And what about Benicio Nowicki?\"], [\"umm how much do I owe, uh, Fionnuala Rivas?\", \"ok and Benicio Nowicki?\"]]}","ttft_ms":10783,"type":"result","duration_ms":29345,"uuid":"9fb2eb8b-17e8-485e-9903-edbf4d6efbc8","ttft_stream_ms":1339,"time_to_request_ms":128,"first_content_frame_ms":1340,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22250203,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278800565.1558,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
